        "title": "Specs&Size",
        "content": "<p>The TM007 is designed for powerful incline training and long-term progress at home. With heavy-duty support up to 400 lbs and 15 levels of automatic incline, it’s built for those committed to burning fat, building endurance, and creating consistent fitness habits—all from the comfort of home.</p>",
